1  ambgnt5f  no  AMBIGUITY_AT_FEATURE_START  feature  1  1  first nucleotide of non-CDS feature is an ambiguous nucleotide
2  ambgnt3f  no  AMBIGUITY_AT_FEATURE_END    feature  1  1  final nucleotide of non-CDS feature is an ambiguous nucleotide
